  message: "Precision on the closure note's counts: 'pm2 package nodes 77 -> 55, knex 60 -> 48' are DISTINCT PACKAGE NAMES (the A/B counted a name set). pm2 on merged dev has 57 package nodes carrying 55 names (example-module and import each have two nodes: one javascript npm stand-in, one json manifest declaration); knex 48 nodes. The core-module removals (22 / 12 names, 301 / 119 import edges) are unaffected."  # 68a9
